[Info]
Name	Mirror Pass
Description	Two keepers face their own reflection across the axis; the gem pit on it is exactly as far from both. Mirror symmetric. 2 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

